[
	# XIME Core — System Overview

	XIME.Core is the foundation module of the XIME framework for the Elarion ecosystem. It hosts the shared infrastructure every other XIME module depends on: event bus, threading dispatcher, caching, networking, location, weather and map services, theming, logging, AI assistant contracts, and a native Vulkan-accelerated frame interpolation engine.

	## AI Assistant (`xime.core.aetheris`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/aetheris`

	* **SARAHAssistantAetheris.java** — Foundational contract for the SARAH (Sovereign Autonomous Resilient Adaptive Hierophant) assistant within XIME.

	## Component Controllers (`xime.core.controller`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/controller`

	* **ComponentController.java** — Base controller that binds component behavior to a View and manages release.
	* **CardController.java** — Specialized controller for card components, extending ComponentController.

	## Caching (`xime.core.cache`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/cache`

	* **CacheManager.java** — Basic memory cache, moved to Core to avoid circular dependencies.
	* **TileCache.java** — LRU in-memory cache for map tiles.

	## Concurrency & Messaging (`xime.core.dispatch` / `xime.core.eventbus`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/dispatch`, `src/main/java/xime/core/eventbus`

	* **Dispatcher.java** — XIME.Core threading dispatcher for background and main-thread execution.
	* **XimeEventBus.java** — Lightweight typed event bus for cross-module pub/sub. Decouples modules that cannot depend on each other directly (e.g., XIME.Media posting track-change events received by a XIME.UI mini-player); both depend only on XIME.Core.

	## Gesture Arbitration (`xime.core.gesture`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/gesture`

	* **GestureArbiter.java** — Central arbiter that resolves competing touch and gesture claims across components.

	## Location Services (`xime.core.location`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/location`

	* **LocationProvider.java** — Fused location provider using Google Play Services with Geocoder reverse lookup support.

	## Logging (`xime.core.log` / `xime.core.logger`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/log`, `src/main/java/xime/core/logger`

	* **ILogger.java** — XIME core logging interface, placed in Core to avoid circular dependencies.
	* **LogcatLogger.java** — Concrete ILogger implementation that logs to Logcat.

	## Data Models (`xime.core.model`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/model`

	* **AirQualityData.java** — Air quality index (AQI) snapshot with timestamp.
	* **MapLocation.java** — Data model for geographic locations in XIME.
	* **WeatherData.java** — Weather snapshot: temperature, weather code, cloud cover, sunrise and sunset.

	## Networking (`xime.core.net`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/net`

	* **IpGeoClient.java** — IP geolocation client using ipapi.co (free tier).
	* **NetClient.java** — Lightweight HTTP client with timeout handling.
	* **TileClient.java** — Fetches map tiles from OpenStreetMap.

	## Repositories (`xime.core.repo`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/repo`

	* **MapRepository.java** — Repository for map data; coordinates IP geolocation and tile fetching.
	* **WeatherRepository.java** — Repository exposing asynchronous weather lookups via callback.

	## Theming (`xime.core.theme`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/theme`

	* **ThemeManager.java** — Central theme state manager and single source of truth for dark/light mode across all XIME System Apps.

	## Utilities (`xime.core.utils`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/utils`

	* **AssetUtils.java** — Helpers for extracting and copying packaged assets to storage.
	* **IOUtils.java** — Stream copy and close utilities.

	## System (`xime.core.system.build` / `xime.core.system.manager`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/core/system/build`, `src/main/java/xime/core/system/manager`

	* **ConfigProjectBuild.java** — Static holder for build configuration: applicationId, build type, version name/code, and debug flag.
	* **AccountManager.java** — Device account, contact, and settings provider access for Xoeris identity services.

	## Native Interpolation Engine (`cpp` + `ncnn-vulkan`)
	Loc: `src/main/cpp`, `src/main/ncnn-vulkan`

	* **lucine-interpolator.c** — Core C implementation of the Lucine frame interpolation pipeline.
	* **rife_ncnn_bridge.cpp** — JNI bridge between the Java layer and RIFE models running on ncnn.
	* **ncnn-vulkan/** — Prebuilt ncnn and glslang static libraries with headers for arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, riscv64, x86, and x86_64.

	## Python Tooling (`python`)
	Loc: `src/main/python`

	* **ai_frame_interpolation.py** — AI-driven frame interpolation entry point.
	* **interpolation_engine.py** — Interpolation engine logic shared by the tooling scripts.

	## Resources (`res`)
	Loc: `src/main/res`

	* **bottom_navigation_menu.xml** — Default menu definition for glassy bottom navigation.
	* **ids.xml** — Shared view ID declarations.
	* **strings.xml** — Core string resources.
]
